The '''JT-12 jetpack''' was a model of [[jetpack]] used during the [[Clone Wars]] by several factions including the [[Galactic Republic]]<ref name="TCW" /> and [[Death Watch]].<ref name="Mandalore Plot" /> Several variations of the jetpack existed including the [[JT-12C jetpack|JT-12C]] and the [[JT-12 EVA jetpack|JT-12 EVA]].<ref name="TVE" /> The jetpack was capable of short and long distance jumps. The average maximum speed in flight was 145 [[Kilometer per hour|kilometers per hour]] (90.1 [[Mile per hour|miles per hour]]).<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> It had a launcher that could accommodate both the [[MM9 mini concussion rocket launcher|MM9]] and the Z-6 anti-vehicle homing [[missile]] in its adapter slot.<ref name="USW">''[[Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition]]''</ref>

